WEBVTT

NOTE StoryCast sample captions for Voices of Kimironko. Timed from synthesised narration.

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.453
<v Narrator>Kimironko market opens before the city's traffic does.

2
00:00:04.753 --> 00:00:11.215
<v Narrator>Colours stack in careful pyramids: tomatoes, passion fruit, and mountains of green beans.

3
00:00:11.865 --> 00:00:18.214
<v Jeanne>Muraho! Come, come. Tell me what you are cooking, and I will tell you what you need.

4
00:00:18.864 --> 00:00:26.044
<v Narrator>Jeanne has sold vegetables here for twelve years. Her stall has no sign, because nobody needs one.

5
00:00:26.694 --> 00:00:30.645
<v Jeanne>Everyone knows my voice. If I am quiet, they worry.

6
00:00:31.295 --> 00:00:39.088
<v Narrator>Around her, vendors trade greetings in Kinyarwanda, French, English, and sometimes all three in one sentence.

7
00:00:39.388 --> 00:00:43.638
<v Narrator>By noon the baskets are lighter, and the conversations are longer.

8
00:00:44.288 --> 00:00:48.458
<v Jeanne>Come back tomorrow. I will save you the sweetest tomatoes.
